          </div>
          <pre class="text-sm font-mono text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed"><code>v2 = [<span class="text-purple-300">0</span>]*<span class="text-purple-300">32</span>
v2[<span class="text-purple-300">0</span>] = <span class="text-purple-300">176</span>
