    encrypt_data[i] = v2[i*<span class="text-purple-300">4</span>] &lt;&lt; <span class="text-purple-300">24</span> | v2[i*<span class="text-purple-300">4</span>+<span class="text-purple-300">1</span>] &lt;&lt; <span class="text-purple-300">16</span> \
                    | v2[i*<span class="text-purple-300">4</span>+<span class="text-purple-300">2</span>] &lt;&lt; <span class="text-purple-300">8</span>  | v2[i*<span class="text-purple-300">4</span>+<span class="text-purple-300">3</span>]</code></pre>
