    <section class="px-6 md:px-16 lg:px-24 py-20 md:py-24 bg-[#0a0a0f] border-t border-zinc-800/40">
      <div class="max-w-3xl reveal-element">
        <p class="section-label text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-zinc-500 font-mono mb-8">11 / 密钥爆破</p>
        <div class="space-y-5 text-base text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-8">
          <p>
            flag 是 <code class="text-[#F97316] bg-zinc-900 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm rounded-sm">sssctf{"{}"}</code> 包裹，所以密钥的前 7 个字节已知为 <code class="text-[#F97316] bg-zinc-900 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm rounded-sm">sssctf{"{"}</code>，只需爆破最后 1 个字节。
          </p>
          <p>
            TEA 解密和 ezMath 类似：倒着运行，加换减，减换加。异或的逆运算就是异或本身。<code class="text-zinc-400 bg-zinc-900 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm rounded-sm">sum</code> 的初始值是 <code class="text-[#F97316] bg-zinc-900 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm rounded-sm">0x61C88647 * -index</code>。Python 注意手动溢出 <code class="text-[#F97316] bg-zinc-900 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm rounded-sm">& 0xFFFFFFFF</code>。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="code-block bg-[#0d1117] border border-zinc-800 p-5 overflow-x-auto rounded-sm">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 pb-3 border-b border-zinc-800/60">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#F97316]/60"></span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500">solve_tea.py</span>
          </div>
          <pre class="text-sm font-mono text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed"><code><span class="text-[#F97316]">for</span> ch <span class="text-[#F97316]">in</span> guess:
    key_str = <span class="text-emerald-400">"sssctf&#123;"</span> + ch  <span class="text-zinc-500"># 8 char</span>
    key = [<span class="text-purple-300">0</span>]*<span class="text-purple-300">4</span>
    <span class="text-[#F97316]">for</span> i <span class="text-[#F97316]">in</span> range(<span class="text-purple-300">0</span>, <span class="text-purple-300">4</span>):
        key[i] = ord(key_str[i*<span class="text-purple-300">2</span>+<span class="text-purple-300">1</span>]) | (ord(key_str[i*<span class="text-purple-300">2</span>]) &lt;&lt; <span class="text-purple-300">8</span>)

    <span class="text-zinc-500"># TEA Decryption</span>
    ori = encrypt_data.copy()
    index = <span class="text-purple-300">12</span>
    sum = (<span class="text-purple-300">0x61C88647</span> * -index) & <span class="text-purple-300">0xFFFFFFFF</span>
    <span class="text-[#F97316]">while</span> index &gt; <span class="text-purple-300">0</span>:
        sum2 = (sum &gt;&gt; <span class="text-purple-300">2</span>) & <span class="text-purple-300">3</span>
        <span class="text-[#F97316]">for</span> i <span class="text-[#F97316]">in</span> range(<span class="text-purple-300">7</span>, -<span class="text-purple-300">1</span>, -<span class="text-purple-300">1</span>):
            ori[i] -= ((ori[(i+<span class="text-purple-300">1</span>) % <span class="text-purple-300">8</span>] ^ sum)
                     + (ori[(i-<span class="text-purple-300">1</span>) % <span class="text-purple-300">8</span>] ^ key[sum2 ^ (i & <span class="text-purple-300">3</span>)])) \
                    ^ (((<span class="text-purple-300">4</span> * ori[(i+<span class="text-purple-300">1</span>) % <span class="text-purple-300">8</span>])
                     ^ (ori[(i-<span class="text-purple-300">1</span>) % <span class="text-purple-300">8</span>] &gt;&gt; <span class="text-purple-300">5</span>))
                     + ((ori[(i+<span class="text-purple-300">1</span>) % <span class="text-purple-300">8</span>] &gt;&gt; <span class="text-purple-300">3</span>)
                     ^ (<span class="text-purple-300">16</span> * ori[(i-<span class="text-purple-300">1</span>) % <span class="text-purple-300">8</span>])))
            ori[i] &= <span class="text-purple-300">0xFFFFFFFF</span>
        sum += <span class="text-purple-300">0x61C88647</span>
        sum &= <span class="text-purple-300">0xFFFFFFFF</span>
        index -= <span class="text-purple-300">1</span>

    <span class="text-zinc-500"># Reconstruct plaintext</span>
    decrypted = <span class="text-emerald-400">""</span>
    <span class="text-[#F97316]">for</span> value <span class="text-[#F97316]">in</span> ori:
        decrypted += chr((value &gt;&gt; <span class="text-purple-300">24</span>) & <span class="text-purple-300">0xFF</span>)
        decrypted += chr((value &gt;&gt; <span class="text-purple-300">16</span>) & <span class="text-purple-300">0xFF</span>)
        decrypted += chr((value &gt;&gt; <span class="text-purple-300">8</span>) & <span class="text-purple-300">0xFF</span>)
        decrypted += chr(value & <span class="text-purple-300">0xFF</span>)
    <span class="text-[#F97316]">if</span> decrypted.startswith(<span class="text-emerald-400">"sssctf&#123;"</span>):
        print(<span class="text-emerald-400">f"Key: &#123;key_str&#125; Flag: &#123;decrypted&#125;"</span>)
        <span class="text-[#F97316]">break</span></code></pre>
        </div>
